# Room 0: Central Command Hub. One screen tall, scrolls sideways. Each themed room's door sits on
# its own platform built from that room's block, forming an easy parkour line that climbs from
# the desert step on the left to the fortress tower on the right (every rise is 2-3 tiles).
# Only door '1' (-> room 1) starts unlocked; the rest need a key. Locked door letters:
#   L -> 2, N -> 3, O -> 4, q -> 5, T -> 6, U -> 7 (the fortress).
# Keys are dropped by defeated enemies and sit in end-of-level crates, so the player clears the
# open room first, then spends keys to unlock the rest.
name: Command Hub
gravity: 1400
